 resulting CSV file as an example.";s:21:"txt_import_data_note2";s:112:"By importing data via the form below you can create new zones and tax rates as well as update the existing ones.";s:32:"txt_import_data_types_js_warning";s:124:"You have selected one or more data types for deletion. Are you sure you want to delete all the data of the selected type(s)?";s:16:"txt_import_error";s:122:"An error occurred during the verification of the CSV file. Please check your CSV file and fix the problem, then try again.";s:18:"txt_log_file_error";s:76:"The LOG file cannot be displayed, please check if this file exists: {{file}}";s:38:"txt_max_file_size_that_can_be_uploaded";s:38:"Maximum file size that can be uploaded";s:22:"txt_source_import_file";s:25:"The source of import file";}